# Doubling Chant's search is a "may" (ChooseCard without Mandatory$): the
# player declines the one same-named card. ChooseCardEffect.java:262-264
# returns with nothing imprinted, so DBChangeZone's Defined$ Imprinted moves
# nothing and the library keeps its Grizzly Bears.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 G
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
tapformana human 4 G
tapformana human 5 G
tapformana human 6 G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 8
queue cardchoice none
resolvestack
